<title>UK: AHB sets 500 million mark FRN due December 2002.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 500 million mark FRN due December 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Lamdesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    06.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE   S06.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.15    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 500 MLN MARK DEAL FROM 06.JUN</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 477</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
